	"Description": "7/2/23 update:\n<br />Updated to include Sam's original clothing colors as well as my slightly-recolored version. There are hair-down options and hair-up options for both color schemes.\n<br />\n<br />The download now includes four separate folders for each option -- there's also a png file included to illustrate which folder is which. V1 is basically vanilla Sam.\n<br />\n<br />When you open the mod folder, you can simply delete the three leftover versions and leave the one you prefer where it is.\n<br />Sorry if that sounds convoluted, it's very simple! :v\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />[s]Finally Sam's turn![/s]\n<br />\n<br />[s]I felt like just trimming down his original hairstyle has been done by everyone and their mother, so I thought it might be fun to give him a whole new style. I'm 100% going for a tiktok skater boy kind of vibe for him lol.[/s]\n<br />[s]I'm also working on a seasonal version already![/s]\n<br />\n<br />[s]I can't believe there's only three more marriage candidates for me to edit... but I have plenty of other ideas to work on once they're all done!\u00A0[/s][b]✌️[/b]",
